Smart firewall alias manager for OPNsense.

Monitors DNS hostnames and URL feeds, then atomically syncs resolved
IPs into pf tables via pfctl -T replace. No filter reload, no dropped
connections.

Features:
- DNS watchers with configurable intervals (10s-3600s), optional direct
  queries to a chosen DNS server with TTL-aware re-checks
- URL feed watchers for threat feeds and cloud provider IP ranges
- Composite watchers: DNS + static IPs/CIDRs + other alias tables
- Atomic pf table updates without filter reload
- Fail-closed: a failed source keeps its last good result (up to 24h)
- Tables refilled from saved state right after a reboot
- Change history, empty-table and size-threshold alerts
- Health check for Monit alerting
- Live status dashboard with per-watcher diagnostics
- IPv4 + IPv6 dual-stack support

WWW: https://github.com/DaneHou/os-aliaser
